 style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">18</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Salary Range:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">$50,772.80 (24.41/hour) - $78,707.20 ($37.84/hour)</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">FLSA:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Exempt (salaried)</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">License:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">None</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">FTE Leader:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">N</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">FTE Hours:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">1.00</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Reports to:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Chief Marketing &amp; Communications Officer</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Job Description Status:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">In progress, information for posting is below</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Position Summary:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">The Marketing &amp; Communications Operations Coordinator supports the successful planning, execution and measurement of projects and campaigns across the Marketing and Communications department. This position coordinates the department’s project management platform, coordinates assignments and timelines, monitors project progress and helps ensure deliverables are completed accurately and on schedule.</span></p><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Serving as a central point of coordination, the Marketing &amp; Communications Operations Coordinator works closely with department leaders, account executives, writers, designers, digital team members, vendors and internal clients to move projects from initial request through completion. The position also provides copywriting and editing support, compiles monthly performance reports and helps connect marketing and communications activities to campaign analytics, organizational goals and return on investment.</span></p><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Education:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\"><li class=\"x_MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Bachelor’s degree in marketing, communications, public relations, business, project management or a related field required.</span></li><li class=\"x_MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Equivalent education and relevant professional experience may be considered.</span></li></ul><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">License and/or certification:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\"><li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">None</span></li></ul><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience managing multiple projects, timelines, stakeholders and deliverables simultaneously required.</span></li><li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience using a project management or workflow platform required.</span></li><li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Minimum of two (2) years’ experience in project coordination, marketing, communications, account service, campaign management or a related field preferred.</span></li><li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience with marketing analytics, campaign reporting or performance measurement preferred.</span></li><li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Healthcare, agency or complex organizational experience preferred.</span></li><li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Must be familiar with AP style.</span></li></ul><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Schedule:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Primarily day shift, Monday through Friday.</span></li><li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Occasional weekends, evenings or holidays as needed. </span></li></ul><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Thanks,</span><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Erin Cowder, SHRM-CP</span></b></p><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Compensation Analyst</span></p><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Human Resources Department</span></p><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Tidal Health</span></b></p><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><b>tidalhealth.org</b></p><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Have a question for HR?&nbsp; Send it to our Shared Services team.</span></p><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><a href=\"https://apps.powerapps.com/play/e/default-ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8/a/7f4b8c55-c804-4afa-93c3-f7308ddcbdae?tenantId=ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8&amp;hint=384e5157-8ea1-4b5c-912b-4a3979a7f5f3&amp;source=sharebutton&amp;sourcetime=1769439969989\">HR Questions &amp; Answers</a></span><i></i></p><p class=\"x_MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}